hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"950","Ahmad bin Abdullah bin Abdul Rahim Al-Barqi told us, Ibn Abi Maryam told us, Yahya bin Ziyad told me, Amara bin Ghaziyeh, on the authority of Harb bin Qais, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Abdullah bin Omar, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “Indeed, God Almighty He likes to be given a concession, just as he hates to be given a disobedience.”"
